{"id":"efd1e0e64a642be925df64413049b50b93f6456a","axis":"silent","repo":"tensorflow/tensorflow","sha":"efd1e0e64a642be925df64413049b50b93f6456a","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"third_party/xla/third_party/tensor_ir/patches/tiling_analysis.patch","lines":["@@ -3,7 +3,7 @@ model evaluation) imported from dynamic-kernel-generator/tensor_ir."," "," diff --git a/include/tensor_ir/Analysis/Tiling/Arch.h b/include/tensor_ir/Analysis/Tiling/Arch.h"," new file mode 100644","-index 0000000..8d4e3e6","+index 0000000..4becf41"," --- /dev/null"," +++ b/include/tensor_ir/Analysis/Tiling/Arch.h"," @@ -0,0 +1,57 @@","@@ -21,8 +21,8 @@ index 0000000..8d4e3e6"," +/// Common parameters for all GPU architectures."," +/// Number of threads per warp."," +constexpr int kWarpSize = 32;","-+/// Size of a cache line in bytes.","-+constexpr int kCacheLineSize = 128;","++/// Size of a memory sector in bytes.","++constexpr int kMemorySectorSize = 32;"," +/// Maximum number of registers per thread."," +constexpr int kMaxRegistersPerThread = 255;"," +/// Maximum number of registers per SM.","@@ -97,7 +97,7 @@ index 0000000..ade5641"," +#endif // TENSOR_IR_ANALYSIS_TILING_ENUMERATE_H_"," diff --git a/include/tensor_ir/Analysis/Tiling/Evaluate.h b/include/tensor_ir/Analysis/Tiling/Evaluate.h"," new file mode 100644","-index 0000000..350dfa8","+index 0000000..403592b"," --- /dev/null"," +++ b/include/tensor_ir/Analysis/Tiling/Evaluate.h"," @@ -0,0 +1,191 @@","@@ -145,7 +145,7 @@ index 0000000..350dfa8"," +/// - The register and shared memory storage, as the peak over the iteration"," +///   spaces. The register storage assumes that every live value of a tile is"," +///   kept in registers.","-+/// - The number of memory accesses and accessed cache lines (loads and stores),","++/// - The number of memory accesses and accessed sectors (loads and stores),"," +///   the number of loop iterations over the reduction tiles, and the number of"," +///   tensor core operations per MMA generation."," +///","@@ -20